1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,680
Kisha barikuwa baini, wote wote, wakinilala, kwa tutu kenyetu.

2
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:14,290
Kwa ngufunamu, nambie tutu kishiti, ndelesha kishilikuwa.

3
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:26,230
Kalika tutu kenyetu likuwa pamuwa yako, nikaonza, barisha kabeva, nahaka ya rutia.

4
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:28,450
Niwafie ni wa garza?

5
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:29,730
Nikafie.

6
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:30,990
Waonza?

7
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:34,390
Waonza, barisha mwwewa.

8
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:41,750
Siyewe kama tarudia, kama atarudia, siyewe, wale baine wote, wote, wote.

9
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:49,020
Kisha kumariza wanawewa nabiyamu nyomba wote, akuna kitu kenyetu.

10
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:52,280
Meva nini achiaka kenyemina wala, akuna chengine.

11
00:00:58,960 --> 00:00:59,840
Pauli Salaman.

12
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:02,960
Kwa ngufuniliya?

13
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,840
Les gars, je sais pas quoi dire, en fait.

14
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,560
Moi, je suis suépaté.

15
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:22,900
La dame, elle a été abisé par quatre hommes.

16
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:26,840
On a essayé d'enlever sa fillette.

17
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:30,300
T'es onze ans, on est parti avec elle.

